{"id":"yzPX6zmaBdg","title":"Talking on the phone – 15 – English at Work has the top tips for you","speaker":"BBC Learning English","channel":"English Learning","level":"B2","duration":"05:11","views":"321K","emoji":"🎬","color":"linear-gradient(135deg, #a1c4fd, #c2e9fb)","zh":"【BBC Learning English】打電話 – 15 – 工作英語為您提供重要提示（精選雙語跟讀教材）","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yzPX6zmaBdg","cues":[{"start":14.03,"duration":1.0,"text":"Yes?","en":"Yes?","zh":"是的？"},{"start":15.03,"duration":1.0,"text":"Stop!","en":"Stop!","zh":"停止！"},{"start":16.03,"duration":2.0,"text":"That's all wrong.","en":"That's all wrong.","zh":"這都是錯的。"},{"start":18.03,"duration":2.0,"text":"I'm going to call you again.","en":"I'm going to call you again.","zh":"我會再打電話給你。"},{"start":20.03,"duration":1.0,"text":"This time…","en":"This time…","zh":"這次…"},{"start":21.03,"duration":1.0,"text":"Hello.","en":"Hello.","zh":"你好。"},{"start":22.03,"duration":5.0,"text":"Here we are in the middle of a telephone training session with Denise and Anna.","en":"Here we are in the middle of a telephone training session with Denise and Anna.","zh":"我們正在與丹尼斯和安娜進行電話訓練。"},{"start":27.03,"duration":1.0,"text":"What fun!","en":"What fun!","zh":"多有趣！"},{"start":28.03,"duration":4.0,"text":"This time you don't say yes when you answer.","en":"This time you don't say yes when you answer.","zh":"這次你回答時沒有說「是」。"},{"start":32.03,"duration":1.0,"text":"It's rude.","en":"It's rude.","zh":"這很粗魯。"},{"start":33.03,"duration":13.37,"text":"Call me and I'll show you how it's done.","en":"Call me and I'll show you how it's done.","zh":"打電話給我，我會告訴你它是如何完成的。"},{"start":46.4,"duration":1.0,"text":"Hello.","en":"Hello.","zh":"你好。"},{"start":47.4,"duration":1.0,"text":"Tip-top trading.","en":"Tip-top trading.","zh":"頂尖交易。"},{"start":48.4,"duration":1.0,"text":"Wow!","en":"Wow!","zh":"哇！"},{"start":49.4,"duration":2.0,"text":"That's good.","en":"That's good.","zh":"那挺好的。"},{"start":51.4,"duration":2.0,"text":"And you can say your name.","en":"And you can say your name.","zh":"你可以說出你的名字。"},{"start":53.4,"duration":1.0,"text":"Hello.","en":"Hello.","zh":"你好。"},{"start":54.4,"duration":1.0,"text":"Tip-top trading.","en":"Tip-top trading.","zh":"頂尖交易。"},{"start":55.4,"duration":1.0,"text":"Denise speaking.","en":"Denise speaking.","zh":"丹妮絲講話。"},{"start":56.4,"duration":1.0,"text":"Try it.","en":"Try it.","zh":"嘗試一下。"},{"start":57.4,"duration":1.0,"text":"Hello.","en":"Hello.","zh":"你好。"},{"start":58.4,"duration":10.73,"text":"Tip-top trading.","en":"Tip-top trading.","zh":"頂尖交易。"},{"start":69.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Denise speaking.","en":"Denise speaking.","zh":"丹妮絲講話。"},{"start":70.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"No.","en":"No.","zh":"不。"},{"start":71.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"What?","en":"What?","zh":"什麼？"},{"start":72.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Say Anna speaking.","en":"Say Anna speaking.","zh":"說安娜說話。"},{"start":73.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Oh, sorry.","en":"Oh, sorry.","zh":"哦，抱歉。"},{"start":74.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"I'm so stressed by all this.","en":"I'm so stressed by all this.","zh":"這一切讓我壓力很大。"},{"start":75.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Hello Anna speaking.","en":"Hello Anna speaking.","zh":"你好，安娜。"},{"start":76.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"You sound like you're sitting on a pineapple.","en":"You sound like you're sitting on a pineapple.","zh":"你聽起來就像坐在鳳梨上。"},{"start":77.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Listen to my voice.","en":"Listen to my voice.","zh":"聽聽我的聲音。"},{"start":78.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Hello.","en":"Hello.","zh":"你好。"},{"start":79.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Denise speaking.","en":"Denise speaking.","zh":"丹妮絲講話。"},{"start":80.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Hello.","en":"Hello.","zh":"你好。"},{"start":81.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Anna speaking.","en":"Anna speaking.","zh":"安娜說話。"},{"start":82.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Hello.","en":"Hello.","zh":"你好。"},{"start":83.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Hello.","en":"Hello.","zh":"你好。"},{"start":84.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Hello.","en":"Hello.","zh":"你好。"},{"start":85.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Hello.","en":"Hello.","zh":"你好。"},{"start":86.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Hello.","en":"Hello.","zh":"你好。"},{"start":87.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Hello.","en":"Hello.","zh":"你好。"},{"start":88.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Hello.","en":"Hello.","zh":"你好。"},{"start":89.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Hello.","en":"Hello.","zh":"你好。"},{"start":90.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Hello.","en":"Hello.","zh":"你好。"},{"start":91.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Hello.","en":"Hello.","zh":"你好。"},{"start":92.13,"duration":2.0,"text":"Anna speaking.","en":"Anna speaking.","zh":"安娜說話。"},{"start":94.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Good.","en":"Good.","zh":"好的。"},{"start":95.13,"duration":3.0,"text":"Now, when the person has introduced themselves,","en":"Now, when the person has introduced themselves,","zh":"現在，當對方自我介紹後，"},{"start":98.13,"duration":3.0,"text":"this is Mrs Smith or whatever, say,","en":"this is Mrs Smith or whatever, say,","zh":"這是史密斯太太或其他什麼人，比如說，"},{"start":101.13,"duration":2.0,"text":"Hello, Mrs Smith.","en":"Hello, Mrs Smith.","zh":"你好，史密斯太太。"},{"start":103.13,"duration":2.0,"text":"How can I help you?","en":"How can I help you?","zh":"我怎麼幫你？"},{"start":105.13,"duration":3.0,"text":"Or if you know them already, you might say,","en":"Or if you know them already, you might say,","zh":"或者如果你已經認識他們，你可能會說，"},{"start":108.13,"duration":2.0,"text":"Hello, Mrs Smith.","en":"Hello, Mrs Smith.","zh":"你好，史密斯太太。"},{"start":110.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"How are you?","en":"How are you?","zh":"你好嗎？"},{"start":111.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"OK.","en":"OK.","zh":"好的。"},{"start":112.13,"duration":3.0,"text":"What if Mrs Smith wants to speak to Tom","en":"What if Mrs Smith wants to speak to Tom","zh":"如果史密斯太太想跟湯姆說話怎麼辦"},{"start":115.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"but he's not there?","en":"but he's not there?","zh":"但他不在？"},{"start":116.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"You say,","en":"You say,","zh":"你說，"},{"start":117.13,"duration":2.0,"text":"I'm really sorry.","en":"I'm really sorry.","zh":"我真的很抱歉。"},{"start":119.13,"duration":2.0,"text":"He's not available at the moment.","en":"He's not available at the moment.","zh":"他現在沒空。"},{"start":121.13,"duration":2.0,"text":"Can I take a message?","en":"Can I take a message?","zh":"我可以留言嗎？"},{"start":123.13,"duration":2.0,"text":"Or I'm afraid he's busy.","en":"Or I'm afraid he's busy.","zh":"或者我擔心他很忙。"},{"start":125.13,"duration":3.0,"text":"Shall I ask him to call you back?","en":"Shall I ask him to call you back?","zh":"要我請他回電給你嗎？"},{"start":128.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"OK.","en":"OK.","zh":"好的。"},{"start":129.13,"duration":2.0,"text":"And to end a conversation,","en":"And to end a conversation,","zh":"並結束對話，"},{"start":131.13,"duration":2.0,"text":"you can say,","en":"you can say,","zh":"你可以說，"},{"start":133.13,"duration":1.0,"text":"Thank you for calling.","en":"Thank you for calling.","zh":"謝謝您的來電。"},{"start":134.13,"duration":2.0,"text":"Goodbye.","en":"Goodbye.","zh":"再見。"},{"start":136.13,"duration":2.0,"text":"Let's do another practice.","en":"Let's do another practice.","zh":"我們再做一次練習。"},{"start":138.13,"duration":13.11,"text":"Hello, Tip Top Trading.","en":"Hello, Tip Top Trading.","zh":"您好，Tip Top 貿易。"},{"start":151.24,"duration":1.0,"text":"Hello.","en":"Hello.","zh":"你好。"},{"start":152.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"This is Mrs Smith.","en":"This is Mrs Smith.","zh":"這是史密斯太太。"},{"start":154.24,"duration":1.0,"text":"Hello, Mrs Smith.","en":"Hello, Mrs Smith.","zh":"你好，史密斯太太。"},{"start":155.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"How can I help you?","en":"How can I help you?","zh":"我怎麼幫你？"},{"start":157.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"I'd like to speak to Tom, please.","en":"I'd like to speak to Tom, please.","zh":"我想和湯姆通話。"},{"start":159.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"I'm really sorry.","en":"I'm really sorry.","zh":"我真的很抱歉。"},{"start":161.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"He's not available at the moment.","en":"He's not available at the moment.","zh":"他現在沒空。"},{"start":163.24,"duration":1.0,"text":"Can I take a message?","en":"Can I take a message?","zh":"我可以留言嗎？"},{"start":164.24,"duration":1.0,"text":"That's OK.","en":"That's OK.","zh":"沒關係。"},{"start":165.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"I'll try again later.","en":"I'll try again later.","zh":"我稍後再試。"},{"start":167.24,"duration":1.0,"text":"OK.","en":"OK.","zh":"好的。"},{"start":168.24,"duration":1.0,"text":"Thank you for calling.","en":"Thank you for calling.","zh":"感謝您打電話。"},{"start":169.24,"duration":1.0,"text":"Goodbye.","en":"Goodbye.","zh":"再見。"},{"start":170.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Excellent.","en":"Excellent.","zh":"出色的。"},{"start":172.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Oh.","en":"Oh.","zh":"哦。"},{"start":174.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"How did you call me without dialing?","en":"How did you call me without dialing?","zh":"你怎麼不撥電話打​​給我？"},{"start":176.24,"duration":1.0,"text":"I didn't.","en":"I didn't.","zh":"我沒有。"},{"start":177.24,"duration":1.0,"text":"That's a real call.","en":"That's a real call.","zh":"這是一個真正的電話。"},{"start":178.24,"duration":1.0,"text":"Oh no.","en":"Oh no.","zh":"哦不。"},{"start":179.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"I'm all nervous now.","en":"I'm all nervous now.","zh":"我現在很緊張。"},{"start":181.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Hello, Tip Top Trading.","en":"Hello, Tip Top Trading.","zh":"您好，Tip Top 貿易。"},{"start":183.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"This is Anna speaking.","en":"This is Anna speaking.","zh":"這是安娜在講話。"},{"start":185.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Hello, Anna.","en":"Hello, Anna.","zh":"你好，安娜。"},{"start":187.24,"duration":1.0,"text":"This is Seb Lime.","en":"This is Seb Lime.","zh":"這是塞布·萊姆。"},{"start":188.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Seb Lime?","en":"Seb Lime?","zh":"塞布·萊姆？"},{"start":190.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Mr Lime from Citrus Ventures.","en":"Mr Lime from Citrus Ventures.","zh":"來自 Citrus Ventures 的 Lime 先生。"},{"start":192.24,"duration":3.0,"text":"But I think we should be on first name terms now.","en":"But I think we should be on first name terms now.","zh":"但我認為我們現在應該直呼其名了。"},{"start":195.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"So call me Seb.","en":"So call me Seb.","zh":"所以叫我塞佈吧。"},{"start":197.24,"duration":1.0,"text":"OK.","en":"OK.","zh":"好的。"},{"start":198.24,"duration":1.0,"text":"Seb.","en":"Seb.","zh":"塞布。"},{"start":199.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"How can I help you?","en":"How can I help you?","zh":"我怎麼幫你？"},{"start":201.24,"duration":4.0,"text":"I just wanted to say again that your Imperial lemon is fantastic.","en":"I just wanted to say again that your Imperial lemon is fantastic.","zh":"我只是想再說一遍，你們的帝國檸檬太棒了。"},{"start":205.24,"duration":5.0,"text":"And I was wondering if you'd like to do lunch with me sometime.","en":"And I was wondering if you'd like to do lunch with me sometime.","zh":"我想知道你是否願意找個時間和我一起吃午餐。"},{"start":210.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Lunch?","en":"Lunch?","zh":"午餐？"},{"start":212.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"I knew it.","en":"I knew it.","zh":"我就知道。"},{"start":214.24,"duration":4.0,"text":"Mr Lime is interested in more than just your lemons.","en":"Mr Lime is interested in more than just your lemons.","zh":"萊姆先生感興趣的不僅是你的檸檬。"},{"start":218.24,"duration":3.0,"text":"Would you like to discuss the Imperial lemon?","en":"Would you like to discuss the Imperial lemon?","zh":"您想討論帝國檸檬嗎？"},{"start":221.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Forget the lemons, Anna.","en":"Forget the lemons, Anna.","zh":"忘記檸檬吧，安娜。"},{"start":223.24,"duration":4.0,"text":"The reason I want to see you is more of a personal nature.","en":"The reason I want to see you is more of a personal nature.","zh":"我想見你的原因更多是出於個人原因。"},{"start":227.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Personnel?","en":"Personnel?","zh":"人員？"},{"start":229.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Can I call you back?","en":"Can I call you back?","zh":"我可以回電給你嗎？"},{"start":231.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"I'm afraid I'm a bit busy at the moment.","en":"I'm afraid I'm a bit busy at the moment.","zh":"恐怕我現在有點忙。"},{"start":234.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Well, Anna.","en":"Well, Anna.","zh":"嗯，安娜。"},{"start":236.24,"duration":1.0,"text":"Mr Lime, eh?","en":"Mr Lime, eh?","zh":"萊姆先生，是嗎？"},{"start":237.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Oh dear, Denise.","en":"Oh dear, Denise.","zh":"喔親愛的，丹妮絲。"},{"start":239.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"I think I need a bit more help from you.","en":"I think I need a bit more help from you.","zh":"我想我需要你更多的幫助。"},{"start":241.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"He wants to talk about personnel.","en":"He wants to talk about personnel.","zh":"他想談談人員問題。"},{"start":243.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"People, starving?","en":"People, starving?","zh":"人們，餓了嗎？"},{"start":245.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Are you sure?","en":"Are you sure?","zh":"你確定嗎？"},{"start":247.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"I think he means a personal nature.","en":"I think he means a personal nature.","zh":"我認為他指的是個人本性。"},{"start":249.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Not personnel.","en":"Not personnel.","zh":"不是人員。"},{"start":251.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"That Mr Lime.","en":"That Mr Lime.","zh":"那個萊姆先生。"},{"start":253.24,"duration":1.0,"text":"Oh.","en":"Oh.","zh":"哦。"},{"start":254.24,"duration":3.0,"text":"Mr Lime indeed.","en":"Mr Lime indeed.","zh":"確實是萊姆先生。"},{"start":257.24,"duration":3.0,"text":"Anyway, Anna had an excellent phone manner.","en":"Anyway, Anna had an excellent phone manner.","zh":"不管怎樣，安娜打電話的態度非常好。"},{"start":260.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Let's hear those phrases again.","en":"Let's hear those phrases again.","zh":"讓我們再聽一次這些短語。"},{"start":262.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Hello to Top Trading.","en":"Hello to Top Trading.","zh":"您好，頂級貿易。"},{"start":264.24,"duration":4.78,"text":"This is Anna speaking.","en":"This is Anna speaking.","zh":"這是安娜在講話。"},{"start":269.02,"duration":2.0,"text":"Hello, Anna speaking.","en":"Hello, Anna speaking.","zh":"你好，安娜。"},{"start":271.02,"duration":2.0,"text":"Hello, Mrs Smith.","en":"Hello, Mrs Smith.","zh":"你好，史密斯太太。"},{"start":273.02,"duration":2.0,"text":"How can I help you?","en":"How can I help you?","zh":"我怎麼幫你？"},{"start":275.02,"duration":1.0,"text":"Hello, Mrs Smith.","en":"Hello, Mrs Smith.","zh":"你好，史密斯太太。"},{"start":276.02,"duration":2.0,"text":"How are you?","en":"How are you?","zh":"你好嗎？"},{"start":278.02,"duration":2.0,"text":"I'm really sorry.","en":"I'm really sorry.","zh":"我真的很抱歉。"},{"start":280.02,"duration":2.0,"text":"He's not available at the moment.","en":"He's not available at the moment.","zh":"他現在沒空。"},{"start":282.02,"duration":2.0,"text":"Can I take a message?","en":"Can I take a message?","zh":"我可以留言嗎？"},{"start":284.02,"duration":2.0,"text":"I'm afraid he's busy.","en":"I'm afraid he's busy.","zh":"我擔心他很忙。"},{"start":286.02,"duration":2.0,"text":"Shall I ask him to call you back?","en":"Shall I ask him to call you back?","zh":"要我請他回電給你嗎？"},{"start":288.02,"duration":2.0,"text":"Thank you for calling. Goodbye.","en":"Thank you for calling. Goodbye.","zh":"感謝您打電話。再見。"},{"start":290.02,"duration":4.0,"text":"But how is Anna going to handle Mr Lime's request?","en":"But how is Anna going to handle Mr Lime's request?","zh":"但安娜將如何處理萊姆先生的請求呢？"},{"start":294.02,"duration":2.0,"text":"I can't wait till next time.","en":"I can't wait till next time.","zh":"我等不及下次了。"},{"start":296.02,"duration":1.0,"text":"Bye.","en":"Bye.","zh":"再見。"}],"words":[]}